      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Psychoanalytically oriented therapies are widespread in the treatment of chronic pain patients in Germany but there are still few evaluation studies especially for long-term therapies. Derived from the therapy process of a homogenous pain group and its evaluation modifications from the usual psychoanalytical group therapy method necessary for pain patients are outlined."},
